WEBVTT
NOTE
Draft captions from the recording script. Re-time every cue against the final recording before publishing.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Contract upgrades replace code but keep stored data. This tutorial shows how Mainstay tests an upgrade before it reaches production.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:01:40.000
A bad upgrade can break reads of existing assets and records, so each upgrade is checked against stored state.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Run cargo test --workspace, then the upgrade-related suites named in the upgrade testing guide.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:04:20.000
The upgrade-test job in the CI workflow deploys the current contracts to a local ledger and proposes an upgrade on each one.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:50.000
Propose an upgrade, wait for the 48-hour timelock, then execute it. Check the state with view functions afterwards.
